# Implementation plan — Spec 1.7.0

## Summary

Spec 1.7.0 adds **`ImagePreview`** to `@webonone/ui-kit` — fixed `w-40 h-40` image display, **view** and **edit** modes, centered edit overlay, and `onEdit` callback for consumers to open the Media selector embed. **Identity** refactors `ProfileAvatarEditor` to use the shared component. See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-image-preview-component.md](./02-image-preview-component.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.7.0` |
| Package build | `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit` before consumer prod builds |
| Media integration | Consumer-only via existing `ProfileMediaSelectorModal` — no UI Kit → Media import |

---

## Phase 1 — ImagePreview component

**Goal:** Export theme-aware `ImagePreview` from UI Kit.

**Exit criteria:** Component builds and exports types.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Create component | `ui-kit/package/src/components/ImagePreview.tsx` |
| Export | `ui-kit/package/src/index.ts` |
| Use `cn`, `Button`, theme tokens | Match Avatar/Card patterns |

**Verify:** `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit`

---

## Phase 2 — Showcase demo

**Goal:** Components tab demo with view/edit toggle.

**Exit criteria:** Type-check passes.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Demo section | `ComponentsPage.tsx` — with-image + without-image (empty icon) side by side |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root`

