## Phase 3 — Identity refactor

**Goal:** Profile avatar editor uses `ImagePreview`.

**Exit criteria:** Profile edit → Media selector unchanged.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Refactor editor | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/components/ProfileAvatarEditor.tsx` |
| Refactor view | `identity/frontend/src/features/profile/components/ProfileView.tsx` |
| Empty state | Centered `Image` icon when `src` is null |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w identity-root`

---

## Cross-service integration

| Layer | Channel |
|-------|---------|
| ImagePreview → Media | Consumer `onEdit` → `CustomDialog` + `MediaSelectorFrame` (Identity) |
| JWT to Media iframe | Unchanged — `sendMediaInit` in consumer |

UI Kit must **not** import `@webonone/media-embed` or Media service code.

