- ClickUp AC text says "40×40 pixels" but specifies `w-40`/`h-40` — follow Tailwind classes (160px), consistent with 1.5.0 profile.
- Showcase uses toast stub instead of live Media iframe (no Media dep in ui-kit showcase).

